  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is implemented in the Philippines. The main outcome areas it contributes to are Countering the threats to democracy and human rights and advancing equality and worker&apos;s rights. The main rights holders are the labour educators and shop stewards within the partner unions and partner cooperatives of LEARN. Through educational module development, trainings and research the project aims to achieve that LEARN increases its relevance to its partners and contributes to the strenghtening of the Philippine labor movement.</narrative>
  </description>
